 interests, independent projects, and approach to practical digital problem-solving."><meta name="twitter:description" content="Meet Bakhtawar Khan, founder of MBK Global. Explore his web development, AI and API interests, independent projects, and approach to practical digital problem-solving."><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/assets/images/portfolio-icon-180.png"><link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest"></head><body data-page="about.html" class="academy page-profile master-refresh"><header class="academy-header" id="top"><a class="academy-brand personal-brand" href="/"><span>Bakhtawar Khan<small>Personal Digital Portfolio · MBK Global</small></span></a><button class="academy-menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="academy-nav">Menu <span>+</span></button><nav id="academy-nav" aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/">Home</a><a aria-current='page' href='/about'>About</a><a href='/projects'>Projects</a><a href='/services'>Services</a><a class='header-cta' href='/hire-me'>Let’s talk <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><details class="portfolio-more"><summary>More</summary><div class="portfolio-panel"><section><h2>Professional work</h2><a href='/case-studies'>Case Studies</a><a href='/changelog'>Projects Changelog</a><a href='/delivered-project'>Process</a><a href='/resources'>Resources</a><a href='/news'>Notes</a></section><section><h2>Contact &amp; career</h2><a href='/book-a-call'>Book a Call</a><a href='/resume'>Resume / CV</a><a href='/hire-me'>Hire Me</a></section><section><h2>Content &amp; media</h2><a href='/gallery'>Gallery</a><a href='/blog'>Blog &amp; Articles</a><a href='/faq'>FAQs</a></section><section><h2>Personal brand</h2><a href='/about-muhammad-bakhtawar-khan'>Founder Profile</a><a href='/social'>Social Profiles</a><a href='/official-links'>Official Links</a></section></div></details><button class="theme-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Switch color theme">◐</button></nav></header>
<a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a><main class="academy-main curated-profile founder-profile comprehensive-about" id="main-content"><section class="profile-opening"><div class="profile-opening-copy"><div class="academy-breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span>Founder profile</div><p class="academy-kicker">THE FOUNDER / A PERSONAL INTRODUCTION</p><h1>Bakhtawar<br><em>Khan.</em></h1><p class="profile-designation">Founder of MBK Global · Independent digital builder</p><p class="profile-deck">I build for the web—and for the people on the other side of the screen. My practice brings together web development, APIs, practical AI and automation to turn complex ideas into useful digital experiences.</p><div class="editorial-actions"><a class='button' href='/projects'>Explore My Work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class='academy-text-link' href='/contact'>Discuss a Project ↗</a></div><p class="profile-note">Independent projects. Continuous learning. A considered approach to every brief.</p></div><figure><img src="/assets/images/gallery/muhammad-bakhtawar-khan-mbk-standing-professional-portrait.png" width="1024" height="1536" fetchpriority="high" alt="Bakhtawar Khan · Founder of MBK Global"><figcaption>BAKHTAWAR KHAN<span>FOUNDER / MBK GLOBAL</span></figcaption></figure></section><section class="founder-focus" aria-labelledby="founder-focus-title"><div class="founder-focus-heading"><p class="academy-kicker" id="founder-focus-title">THE THREADS THAT CONNECT MY WORK</p><a class='academy-text-link' href='/services'>Explore services ↗</a></div><div class="founder-focus-grid"><article><span>01 / BUILD</span><h2>Thoughtful web experiences.</h2><p>JavaScript, React and responsive interfaces, with attention to accessibility, performance and the details that make a website feel right.</p></article><article><span>02 / CONNECT</span><h2>Tools that work together.</h2><p>APIs, practical AI and automation. Connecting systems around a real need, with clear boundaries and people in the loop.</p></article><article><span>03 / MAKE IT CLEAR</span><h2>Purpose beyond the pixels.</h2><p>Technical SEO, useful content and a consistent digital identity. Helping people understand the work and find their next step.</p></article></div></section><div class="founder-statement"><p class="academy-kicker">THE IDEA BEHIND THE BRAND</p><p>Technology, creativity and practical problem-solving—<em>connected by the person doing the work.</em></p><span>MBK GLOBAL / INDEPENDENT DIGITAL PROJECTS</span></div><section class="profile-chapter"><div class="chapter-marker">01 / THE VISION</div><div><h2>An identity built through work.</h2><p>MBK Global represents my ambition to bring modern web experiences, connected tools and practical digital solutions together. It gives different projects a recognizable home without obscuring the person responsible for them.</p><p>I want that identity to stand for consistency: clear information, considered design, honest scope and useful outcomes. The brand is a direction I am developing through projects and learning, not a claim about company size, revenue, staff or an established commercial history.</p><p>This is the main public profile of Bakhtawar Khan. For a complementary view of my learning interests and working principles, explore the personal perspective linked below.</p><a class='academy-text-link' href='/muhammad-bakhtawar-khan-digital-portfolio'>Read the personal perspective ↗</a></div></section><section class="profile-chapter"><div class="chapter-marker">02 / THE PROJECT FAMILY</div><div><h2>Several ideas.<br><em>One developing practice.</em></h2><section class="ecosystem" aria-labelledby="ecosystem-title"><div class="ecosystem-heading"><p class="academy-kicker">THE PROJECT FAMILY / SEVEN DISTINCT IDEAS</p><h2 id="ecosystem-title">A connected digital<br><em>product ecosystem.</em></h2><p>Explore each product on its own terms. Linked destinations are existing project URLs, not a guarantee of current availability.</p></div><div class="ecosystem-grid"><article class="ecosystem-product product-0"><div class="product-art" aria-hidden="true"><span>TV</span></div><p class="academy-kicker">Media discovery</p><h3>MBK TV</h3><p>An interface for discovering available television channels. Availability depends on the underlying content sources.</p><div class="product-actions"><a href="https://mbktv.vercel.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit project ↗</a><a href='/article-mbk-tv'>Project context ↗</a></div></article><article class="ecosystem-product product-1"><div class="product-art" aria-hidden="true"><span>01↗</span></div><p class="academy-kicker">Data interfaces</p><h3>MBK Markets</h3><p>A market-data interface exploring cryptocurrency information and charts. Verify current sources before relying on data.</p><div class="product-actions"><a href="https://mbkmarkets.vercel.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit project ↗</a><a href='/article-mbk-markets'>Project context ↗</a></div></article><article class="ecosystem-product product-2"><div class="product-art" aria-hidden="true"><span>↓</span></div><p class="academy-kicker">Web utilities</p><h3>MBK Video Downloader</h3><p>A link-based utility for supported media sources. Platform support and the current redirect destination need review.</p><div class="product-actions"><a href="https://mbkdownloader.vercel.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit project ↗</a><a href='/article-mbk-tools'>Project context ↗</a></div></article><article class="ecosystem-product product-3"><div class="product-art" aria-hidden="true"><span>Aa</span></div><p class="academy-kicker">Creative tools</p><h3>MBK Text to Handwriting</h3><p>A separate utility that presents typed text in a handwriting-inspired format.</p><div class="product-actions"><a href="https://handster.netlify.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit project ↗</a><a href='/article-mbk-tools'>Project context ↗</a></div></article><article class="ecosystem-product product-4"><div class="product-art" aria-hidden="true"><span>نور</span></div><p class="academy-kicker">Reading experiences</p><h3>Noor Quran</h3><p>A Quran-reading resource with a focus on calm, legible content presentation.</p><div class="product-actions"><a href="https://noorquranbymbk.vercel.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit project ↗</a><a href='/article-noor-e-quran'>Project context ↗</a></div></article><article class="ecosystem-product product-5"><div class="product-art" aria-hidden="true"><span>W</span></div><p class="academy-kicker">AI exploration</p><h3>Warm GPT by MBK Global</h3><p>Project name supplied by the owner. Description, implementation details and destination have not yet been provided.</p><div class="product-actions"><span class="project-pending">Details pending · Not linked</span></div></article><article class="ecosystem-product product-6"><div class="product-art" aria-hidden="true"><span>≋</span></div><p class="academy-kicker">Audio &amp; accessibility</p><h3>AI Text to Voice</h3><p>A text-to-audio direction related to the existing planned text-to-speech entry. No verified live destination is available.</p><div class="product-actions"><span class="project-pending">Details pending · Not linked</span></div></article></div></section></div></section><section class="profile-chapter"><div class="chapter-marker">03 / THE DIRECTION</div><div><h2>A practice shaped by projects.</h2><ol class="direction-path"><li><h3>Explore the problem</h3><p>Use independent projects and research to understand a user need and the systems around it.</p></li><li><h3>Strengthen the foundations</h3><p>Improve development skills, architecture, reliability, accessibility and the clarity of the project’s content.</p></li><li><h3>Connect with purpose</h3><p>Explore APIs, practical AI, chatbots and automation where they genuinely improve a workflow.</p></li></ol><p>These are priorities rather than dated career milestones. I want future opportunities and collaborations to follow from stronger work, clearer communication and a better understanding of the problems being solved.</p></div></section><section class="profile-chapter"><div class="chapter-marker">04 / PRINCIPLES</div><div><h2>Credibility is a design decision, too.</h2><p>A professional identity is more than a visual mark. It is also how a brief is scoped, how a limitation is explained and how a product behaves when something goes wrong. I value clarity over unnecessary complexity, substance over appearances and careful execution over promises that cannot be supported.</p><p>That includes privacy-conscious development, accessible experiences and authorized technical research. As the work evolves, I want the same principles to remain visible across the personal portfolio and MBK Global.</p></div></section><section class="profile-chapter"><div class="chapter-marker">05 / WORKING PROCESS</div><div><h2>From a clear brief to a considered delivery.</h2><p>Each project is different, but the work follows a practical sequence that keeps decisions visible and outcomes connected to the original need.</p><ol class="direction-path"><li><h3>Understand the requirement</h3><p>Clarify the audience, problem, goals, constraints and the information that must remain protected.</p></li><li><h3>Plan the experience</h3><p>Organize the content, routes, dependencies and smallest useful scope before adding visual detail.</p></li><li><h3>Design with purpose</h3><p>Shape hierarchy, interaction and responsive behavior around the people who will use the result.</p></li><li><h3>Develop carefully</h3><p>Build on reliable foundations, preserve useful behavior and keep the implementation understandable.</p></li><li><h3>Test the complete path</h3><p>Review links, keyboard access, contrast, responsive layouts, failure states and the agreed functionality.</p></li><li><h3>Deliver with context</h3><p>Explain what was built, identify known limits and leave a clear path for future refinement.</p></li></ol><div class="editorial-actions"><a class='academy-text-link' href='/delivered-project'>Explore the delivery process ↗</a><a class='academy-text-link' href='/services'>Review services ↗</a></div></div></section><section class="profile-chapter"><div class="chapter-marker">06 / USEFUL DETAILS</div><div><h2>A few practical answers.</h2><div class="profile-faq"><details><summary>What connects Bakhtawar Khan and MBK Global?</summary><p>Bakhtawar Khan is the founder and personal identity behind MBK Global. MBK is the professional short name; the brand connects the independent projects presented in this portfolio.</p></details><details><summary>Where can I review projects and current services?</summary><p>Use the Projects and Services pages for context, then confirm availability and scope through a project enquiry. Linked projects can change over time.</p></details><details><summary>What should a collaboration enquiry include?</summary><p>Share the problem, audience, intended outcome, approximate budget, timeline and relevant references. Do not send passwords, API keys or confidential customer information.</p></details><details><summary>Which profiles and contact details are official?</summary><p>The Official Links and Social Profiles pages collect the public destinations listed on this portfolio. The Contact page provides email and WhatsApp options.</p></details></div><a class='academy-text-link' href='/faq'>More service and project questions ↗</a></div></section><section class="profile-chapter"><div class="chapter-marker">NEXT / CONTACT</div><div><h2>Start with a real conversation.</h2><p>Explore the work, bring a specific question or share an idea for a collaboration. We can discuss whether it fits, what it needs and what a sensible next step looks like.</p><div class="editorial-actions"><a class='academy-text-link' href='/hire-me'>Start a project ↗</a><a class='academy-text-link' href='/official-links'>Official links ↗</a><a class='academy-text-link' href='/social'>Social profiles ↗</a><a class="academy-text-link" href="mailto:Bakhtawark085@gmail.com">Email Bakhtawar ↗</a><a class="academy-text-link" href="https://wa.me/923200276941">WhatsApp ↗</a></div></div></section><details class="academy-directory"><summary>Explore the complete MBK directory <span>+</span></summary><section aria-labelledby="mbk-directory-heading" class="section wrap mbk-site-directory"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">MBK PORTFOLIO / SITE DIRECTORY</p><h2 id="mbk-directory-heading">Explore the <em>full portfolio.</em></h2></div><p class="page-intro">Browse Bakhtawar Khan (MBK), MBK Global projects, services, technical guides and official contact resources.</p></div><div class="mbk-directory-group"><h3>Profile &amp; contact</h3><ul><li><a href='/about-muhammad-bakhtawar-khan'>Mr. Bakhtawar | Founder of MBK Global <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li><li><a href='/about'>About Bakhtawar Khan (MBK) <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li><li><a href='/book-a-call'>Book a Call | Bakhtawar Khan <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li><li><a href='/case-studies'>Digital Project Case Studies | Bakhtawar Khan (MBK) <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li><li><a href='/changelog'>Website Changelog <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li><li><a href='/contact'>Contact Bakhtawar Khan (MBK) <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li><li><a href='/delivered-project'>Project Process &amp; Delivery | Bakhtawar Khan (MBK) <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li><li><a href='/faq'>FAQs | Bakhtawar Khan (MBK) Digital Services <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li><li><a href='/gallery'>Bakhtawar Khan Photos &amp; Portfolio Gallery | MBK <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li><li><a href='/hire-me'>Hire Bakhtawar Khan (MBK) | Web, API &amp; Automation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li><li><a href="/">Mr. Bakhtawar | Founder of MBK Global — Web Development, AI &amp; Digital Technology <span ari